# IMPORTANT: Project Work Files ARE TRACKED
# The following are the ACTUAL PROJECT and MUST be committed to git:
# ✓ /PRD.md and /PRD_*.md - Project requirements (TRACK THESE)
# ✓ /ai_project/specs/ - All specifications (TRACK THESE)
# ✓ /ai_project/tasks/ - All task lists (TRACK THESE)
# ✓ /ai_project/state/ - Session state for recovery (TRACK THESE)
# ✓ /ai_project/contexts/ - Project-specific directives (TRACK THESE)
# ✓ /ai_project/resources/ - Project assets and examples (TRACK THESE)

# Only ignore truly temporary/personal files:
# - Build artifacts are already ignored above (dist/, build/, node_modules/)
# - Secrets are already ignored above (.env files)
# - OS junk is already ignored above (.DS_Store, etc.)
# - The actual project work MUST be tracked in version control
UPDATE_PROMPT.md
.claude/.completion_summary

